  "body": "When searching for something contained in another view, the respective item is not highlighted when opening a new view. Thus, if the result is contained in a large diagram, it is difficult to find it afterwards.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n- Search for an item in a large view.\n- Select the view from the results.\n- See that you cannot find the item you searched for quickly.",
